  "mapping_interpretation": "The two maps are declared common aggregations based on the official hierarchy, not an official pixel transition crosswalk. No assumption that all new class 6 pixels previously belonged to class 3. The residual cannot be attributed uniquely to algorithm changes, boundary changes or class definition changes without spatial cross-tabulation.",
